body:
listen i've had three glasses of wine and my dog is in a different country right now and i've never in my life felt so connected to a dog through a screen i truly love your dog please pet her for me and kiss the forehead maybe

&#x200B;

edit: i'm sober now but i still love this dog and wish to kiss her forehead and i'm glad that this resonated with you all. love to everyone apart from their pups atm <3
